#NEXUS

[ xu2002d_fig2: Coelurosaur summary consensus. Oviraptorosauria, joined by an arrow to a node dot, is kept as an internal label. The stem from the Ornitholestes node runs straight across the vertical that carries the Paraves, Alvarezsauridae and oviraptorosaur-therizinosauroid lines; it is read as entering that vertical (a three-way node), and its continuation as the oviraptorosaur-therizinosauroid stem, the only reading in which every line has a parent, as in earlier batches. The seven-way oviraptorid node is entered at Oviraptor philoceratops' height. 19 tips, 2 polytomies (3, 7 children); 1 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=19;
    TAXLABELS
        Allosaurus
        Tyrannosauridae
        Ornithomimosauria
        Ornitholestes_hermanni
        Avialae
        Troodontidae
        Dromaeosauridae
        Incisivosaurus_gauthieri
        Caudipteryx_zoui
        Avimimus_portentosus
        Microvenator_celer
        Chirostenotes_pergracilis
        'IGM 100/42'
        Oviraptor_philoceratops
        Ingenia_yanshini
        Oviraptor_mongoliensis
        Conchoraptor_gracilis
        Therizinosauroidea
        Alvarezsauridae
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE xu2002d_fig2 = [&R] (Allosaurus,(Tyrannosauridae,(Ornithomimosauria,(Ornitholestes_hermanni,((Avialae,(Troodontidae,Dromaeosauridae)),((Incisivosaurus_gauthieri,(Caudipteryx_zoui,(Avimimus_portentosus,Microvenator_celer,Chirostenotes_pergracilis,'IGM 100/42',Oviraptor_philoceratops,Ingenia_yanshini,(Oviraptor_mongoliensis,Conchoraptor_gracilis))))Oviraptorosauria,Therizinosauroidea),Alvarezsauridae)))));
END;
